WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.979 --> 00:00:06.270
I Am Legend is about a zombie-like horde wiping
out much of humanity, but its confusing ending

00:00:06.270 --> 00:00:11.049
and butterfly symbolism become a lot more
clear if you understand the personal journey

00:00:11.049 --> 00:00:11.720
of its hero.

00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:18.140
Created by genetically altering measles, the
Krippin Virus seemed like a "miracle cure."

00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:23.660
Unfortunately, after its initial promise,
the virus mutates with catastrophic results.

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:30.800
The virus kills 5.4 billion people, with 5%
transformed into zombie- or vampire-like "Darkseekers."

00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:35.680
One percent of the population remains immune,
which includes Neville, a virologist for the

00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:37.620
U.S. Army played by Will Smith.

00:00:37.860 --> 00:00:41.740
Neville remains in New York City after it
is placed in military quarantine.

00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:47.010
Although Neville is nearly entirely alone
in New York, he's still got his faithful dog

00:00:47.010 --> 00:00:48.040
Sam for company.

00:00:48.460 --> 00:00:53.470
Although Neville's world-saving quest to create
an antidote gives him long-term purpose, his

00:00:53.470 --> 00:00:57.500
nurturing and caring for Sam gives him a reason
to continue in a daily basis.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:00:59.580
Sam provides immediate meaning.

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:06.000
A series of flashbacks slowly reveal events
before the quarantine, contextualizing Neville's

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:06.500
mindset.

00:01:07.010 --> 00:01:11.800
These flashbacks depict the critical moment
Neville evacuates his wife Zoe and daughter

00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:12.300
Marley.

00:01:12.540 --> 00:01:17.580
Then tragedy strikes when another helicopter
collides with Zoe and Marley's helicopter,

00:01:17.580 --> 00:01:18.080
killing them.

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:22.420
Shortly before her death, Neville had promised
Marley that he would make the monsters go

00:01:22.420 --> 00:01:22.920
away.

00:01:23.180 --> 00:01:28.300
It becomes clear from that point that present-day
Neville is seeking personal salvation in finding

00:01:28.300 --> 00:01:33.820
the cure; not only for the future of humanity,
but so his family's death won't be in vain.

00:01:34.140 --> 00:01:37.360
The death of Zoe and Marley also explains
Sam's value.

00:01:39.260 --> 00:01:40.720
"Sam, you protect daddy, okay?"

00:01:40.720 --> 00:01:42.820
"No, I can't take a dog."

00:01:46.880 --> 00:01:52.280
From that moment on, Sam becomes a living
remnant of Neville's old life, the only family

00:01:52.280 --> 00:01:54.100
member he can love and care for.

00:01:55.320 --> 00:01:59.480
Bob Marley's song "3 little birds" is intertwined
with the theme of I Am Legend.

00:01:59.960 --> 00:02:04.540
The song stands for belief in a brighter future
and inspires Neville in times of need.

00:02:04.940 --> 00:02:09.460
It also facilitates a form of cathartic escapism
that guards Neville from insanity.

00:02:10.020 --> 00:02:15.180
His daughter was named after the cultural
icon, implying that long before the end-of-world

00:02:15.180 --> 00:02:18.620
events, the original Marley was an inspiration
for Neville.

00:02:18.760 --> 00:02:23.780
A conversation at one point with fellow survivor
Anna near the end of the film even suggests

00:02:23.780 --> 00:02:27.240
that Neville chose his career as a virologist
thanks to Marley.

00:02:27.700 --> 00:02:29.720
While talking to Anna, Neville says:

00:02:30.180 --> 00:02:35.959
"He had this idea—it was kinda a virologists
idea—he believed that you could cure racism

00:02:35.960 --> 00:02:40.540
and hate, literally cure it, by injecting
music and love into people's lives."

00:02:41.650 --> 00:02:46.820
In an act of revenge for trapping a Darkseeker
for his tests, Neville falls into a trap and

00:02:46.820 --> 00:02:51.840
is ambushed by other Darkseekers, including
canines also infected with the virus.

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:57.080
After escaping to the safety of his home,
Neville realizes his dog Sam is infected.

00:02:57.400 --> 00:03:00.400
Unlike her owner, Sam isn't immune from the
virus.

00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:04.830
In a scene that would melt the coldest of
hearts, Neville is forced to strangle his

00:03:04.830 --> 00:03:06.660
best friend and only companion.

00:03:07.020 --> 00:03:11.980
Sam's death alone doesn't break Neville—it's
everything her death represents.

00:03:12.200 --> 00:03:17.459
She's the tie to his past life, a daily reminder
of his motivation to find redemption, and

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:21.980
a buffer between being alone and experiencing
suffocating loneliness.

00:03:23.049 --> 00:03:28.519
Rationality is replaced by rage when Neville
embarks on a suicidal act of revenge.

00:03:28.519 --> 00:03:33.879
Just as Neville is about to become an evening
snack, a beam of light scares the Darkseekers

00:03:33.880 --> 00:03:34.380
away.

00:03:34.640 --> 00:03:39.880
After three years with no response to his
radio broadcast, another face of humanity

00:03:39.880 --> 00:03:41.000
has finally arrived.

00:03:41.230 --> 00:03:46.180
However, rather than express gratitude for
saving him, Neville is dismissive and struggles

00:03:46.180 --> 00:03:46.880
to communicate.

00:03:47.520 --> 00:03:53.940
"Every single person that you or I has ever
known is dead!"

00:03:55.209 --> 00:04:01.040
As I Am Legend reaches its climax, the situation
becomes desperate when a large group of Darkseekers

00:04:01.040 --> 00:04:02.400
invade Neville's home.

00:04:02.480 --> 00:04:06.440
Neville, Anna, and Ethan flee to the basement
laboratory for safety.

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:09.860
There they discover that Neville's antidote
is finally working.

00:04:10.360 --> 00:04:15.100
The Darkseekers make their way to the lab,
with one taking lead and smashing himself

00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:16.360
into the glass partition.

00:04:16.660 --> 00:04:21.280
When the leader smashes himself into the glass,
the cracks resemble a butterfly.

00:04:21.500 --> 00:04:26.600
Taking notice of the butterfly tattoo on Anna's
neck, Neville has a realization that this

00:04:26.600 --> 00:04:29.100
might indeed be divine intervention.

00:04:29.470 --> 00:04:33.500
This connects to a gesture from Neville's
daughter Marley earlier in the film:

00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:35.340
"Mommy, look it's a butterfly."

00:04:35.340 --> 00:04:36.040
"Marley, enough!"

00:04:37.340 --> 00:04:39.260
Neville understands this is no coincidence.

00:04:40.720 --> 00:04:44.160
After a moment of realization, Neville takes
action.

00:04:44.160 --> 00:04:49.070
He draws blood containing the cure from the
Darkseeker test subject and gives it to Anna

00:04:49.070 --> 00:04:49.900
and her son.

00:04:50.080 --> 00:04:54.460
After seeing that his efforts to make a cure
weren't in vain, Neville is now comfortable

00:04:54.460 --> 00:04:57.880
paying the ultimate hero's sacrifice to save
Anna and Ethan.

00:04:58.000 --> 00:05:03.220
After Neville's selfless final act, Anna and
Ethan make it to the colony and hand over

00:05:03.220 --> 00:05:05.020
the vial containing the cure.

00:05:05.320 --> 00:05:07.340
Neville has become the titular legend.

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:13.650
In the alternate ending of I Am Legend, the
themes of the story are drastically changed.

00:05:13.650 --> 00:05:19.000
The Darkseeker alpha wipes his own blood onto
the glass in the shape of a butterfly.

00:05:19.120 --> 00:05:24.300
Neville then turns to the Darkseeker test
subject on his table, the one he's cured,

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:26.900
and notices a butterfly tattoo on her neck.

00:05:27.020 --> 00:05:32.560
Neville takes a leap of faith and opens the
glass partition, risking his life to reunite

00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:33.520
the Darkseekers.

00:05:33.660 --> 00:05:38.860
Once Neville's awakened the female, the two
Darkseekers embrace in a moment of surprising

00:05:38.860 --> 00:05:39.380
humanity.

00:05:39.700 --> 00:05:44.380
Smith's character realizes that the mutants
are able to express love and are closer to

00:05:44.380 --> 00:05:45.940
humanity than he realized.

00:05:46.620 --> 00:05:51.440
From the Darkseekers' perspective, Neville
preyed on them, kidnapping and experimenting

00:05:51.440 --> 00:05:53.660
on their friends, family, and loved ones.

00:05:54.020 --> 00:05:58.371
He's a legend, but for the wrong reasons—in
line with the original book, he has become

00:05:58.380 --> 00:06:00.460
the monstrous legend of a new world.

